  "stories": [
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Profile",
        "zh": "客观履历",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "One of Rhodes Island's core Operators. On the battlefield, he rushes to the vanguard to protect his teammates, but back at the Ark, he quietly dedicates himself to logistical duties.",
        "zh": "罗德岛的基础干员之一，上战场冲在最前线保护队友，回到方舟上退居后勤默默工作的实干型角色。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "DIRECT"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Clinical Analysis",
        "zh": "临床诊断分析",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Imaging tests show the indistinct outlines of internal organs, obscured by abnormal shadows. Originium granules detected in the circulatory system. The subject is confirmed to be infected with Oripathy.\n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 11%\nNo major infection symptoms have yet appeared. \n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] 0.22u/L\nSeverity of infection remains low, with no major hindrance on motor functions.",
        "zh": "造影检测结果显示，该干员体内脏器轮廓模糊，可见异常阴影，循环系统内源石颗粒检测异常，有矿石病感染迹象，现阶段可确认为矿石病感染者。\n\n【体细胞与源石融合率】11%\n体表暂未出现明显的矿石病病征。\n\n【血液源石结晶密度】0.22u/L\n感染程度尚浅，暂时还没有带来明显身体影响。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "25"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 1",
        "zh": "档案资料一",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "A veteran Operator of Rhodes Island in both age and experience, Noir Corne's habit of wearing a mask often makes him seem unapproachable. However, those who converse with him quickly find that he is an easygoing, brotherly figure who gets along well with his juniors and never touts his seniority.",
        "zh": "罗德岛的老牌干员，年纪在干员中也偏大，因为戴着面具，常给人以难以交流的印象。 不过交流之后就会发现，本人从不摆出前辈或年长者的架子，是能和年轻人打成一片的活泼大哥哥。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "50"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 2",
        "zh": "档案资料二",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Noir Corne keeps a huge collection of masks in his room. He'll wear the most suitable mask for each occasion. \nThe mask he is seen with most frequently also seems to be his favorite. In his own words, 'This one best suits Rhodes Island's ambience.' \nBy the way, his mask does not hide any terrible secrets.",
        "zh": "黑角的房间里收藏着各式各样的面具，在不同的节日，他会戴上符合节日氛围的面具。\n平时穿戴的似乎是他最喜欢的一款，用他的话说，就是“俺觉得这一款最搭罗德岛的氛围”。\n顺便一提，面具下并没有见不得人的秘密。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "100"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 3",
        "zh": "档案资料三",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "The most peculiar thing about Noir Corne's personality is his caution around Yato - not fear, but a conspicuous, careful deference so as to avoid angering her - which has spawned plenty of gossip among the operators. \nHowever, neither their backgrounds nor their interactions seem to clarify why.",
        "zh": "黑角的性格中，唯一有些令人在意的地方，就是他似乎有些畏惧夜刀。并不是恐惧，而是不想惹她生气的感觉。这引起了一些比较八卦的干员的注意。 \n不过无论是两人的履历还是相处模式，都无法看出更多的东西。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "150"
    }
  ]
}
